{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-Time Warfare: Three Kingdoms is a real-time sandbox strategy game. The core objective is to develop military power and politics, strengthening the nation. All players are spread across a large, finite world map, where territorial resources are finite and players compete for them. In this world, every inch of land is up for grabs. Players develop internal affairs, recruit troops, make friends, and build their own sphere of influence from the ground up.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3091020?t=1756342752","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091020/6ff2dc555c68ee01fe06dbe36987d69e540d560d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756342752","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091020/7f3baba87d75ca75b007836c529c7bb959bd6ef2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756342752","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091020/7f3baba87d75ca75b007836c529c7bb959bd6ef2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756342752","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-Time Warfare: Three Kingdoms is a real-time sandbox strategy game. The core objective is to develop military power and politics, strengthening the nation. All players are spread across a large, finite world map, where territorial resources are finite and players compete for them. In this world, every inch of land is up for grabs. Players develop internal affairs, recruit troops, make friends, and build their own sphere of influence from the ground up.</p>","developers":["Surviv